This repository contains only the port: a loader and compatibility layer.

Heart Star itself -- its code, artwork, audio and data -- is the
property of Adventure Islands and is NOT included or redistributed here. The
port loads those files from a copy of the game that the user provides.

source/so_util.c follows the design of the so_util.c used by the Android
wrapper ports for the PS Vita and Nintendo Switch (MIT licensed; Andy Nguyen
"TheFloW", Rinnegatamante, fgsfds and the ports built on their work). It was
rewritten for this port around PT_DYNAMIC and DT_HASH.

source/sdl_procs.h is generated from the function list in SDL 2.0.12's
src/dynapi/SDL_dynapi_procs.h (SDL is zlib licensed, Copyright (C) 1997-2020
Sam Lantinga). It contains function names only, no SDL code.

The port links against devkitPro's libnx, switch-sdl2 and mesa packages, each
under its own license.
